Images in docs/images/, all made from this repository:

- demo.gif, forged.gif, major.gif: recordings of examples/demo.rs, made with
  prec from render/terminal.toml and the tapes in render/terminal/, converted
  with pconv.
- update-paired.png: drawn by pcmp (pito-compare) from
  render/charts/update.toml, numbers from examples/speed.rs.
- size-bars.png: drawn by pcmp (pito-compare) from render/charts/size.toml,
  sizes of two stripped release builds of a small app, with and without renew.

